{"id": "1984-s0071", "text": "（二）试用期满，经考核合格后，予以正式聘用，签订5年服务期聘用合同（含试用期）；", "label": [], "labels": [], "meta": {"id": "1984-s0071", "global_id": "1984", "source_domain": "事业单位招聘", "title": "儋州市正德学校2023年公开招聘教师", "repartition_split": "test", "empty_hint": "review_shiye_maybe_empty", "track": "iaa_dual_blind_300", "prelabel": "none_dual_blind", "do_not_train": true, "do_not_overwrite_gold_v2": true}}
{"id": "1984-s0074", "text": "七、招聘工作纪律（一）教师招聘工作是一项严肃认真、政策性强的工作。", "label": [], "labels": [], "meta": {"id": "1984-s0074", "global_id": "1984", "source_domain": "事业单位招聘", "title": "儋州市正德学校2023年公开招聘教师", "repartition_split": "test", "empty_hint": "review_shiye_maybe_empty", "track": "iaa_dual_blind_300", "prelabel": "none_dual_blind", "do_not_train": true, "do_not_overwrite_gold_v2": true}}
